16. Having tattoos, piercings, significant facial hair (e.g., whiskers), scars, deformities, unhealed wounds, active skin diseases or inflammation or infections (e.g., herpes, acne, eczema, dermatitis, psoriasis, and herpes zoster), abscess, cancers or precancerous lesions, etc. above the subnasale that may affect the efficacy evaluation or increase treatment-related risk;
