* PD diagnosis according to UK Parkinson's Disease Society Brain Bank Clinical Diagnostic Criteria (UKPDS);
* Age between 18 and 80 years (inclusive);
* Hoehn \& Yahr staging \> 1;

Exclusion Criteria:

