Inclusion Criteria:

1. Male or female subjects who are 18 years of age or older with an interest in the effacement of glabellar rhytides, with or without previous Botulinum Toxin Type A exposure;
2. In good physical and mental health as determined by the investigator based on medical history, physical examination, and/or clinical laboratory tests;
